const pages=['词汇表','学习生词','词汇卡片','综合练习','连词成句','学习统计'];
let storageOK=true,store={active:null,profiles:{}};
try{let raw=localStorage.getItem(STORE);if(raw){let parsed=JSON.parse(raw);if(parsed&&parsed.profiles)store=parsed}}catch(e){storageOK=false}
let student=store.active?store.profiles[store.active]:null;
if(!student){store.active='local';student=store.profiles.local||createStudent('','');store.profiles.local=student;}
let ui=student?.ui||{page:0,g:0,idx:0,pinyin:false};
let speed=1,playback=null,audioGeneration=0;
const group=g=>WORDS.slice(g*10,g===4?WORDS.length:g*10+10);
const groupOf=id=>Math.min(4,Math.floor(id/10));
const escapeHTML=t=>String(t).replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#51;'}[c]));
const hasLearned=id=>!!student?.studied.includes(id);
const learned=g=>group(g).filter(d=>hasLearned(d.id)).length;
const allLearned=()=>!!student&&student.studied.length===WORDS.length;
const memory=id=>student?.memory[id]||'new';
const weakIds=()=>WORDS.filter(d=>memory(d.id)==='review').map(d=>d.id);
const totalLearned=()=>student?.studied.length||0;
const currentWord=()=>group(ui.g)[ui.idx];
function gate(){return `<div class="ntc-panel ntc-lock"><div class="ntc-kicker">先学习生词，再进行全课复习</div><h2>请先完成生词学习</h2><p>已学习 ${totalLearned()}/52 个词语。学完5组词语后，即可进行词汇卡片、综合练习和连词成句。</p>${meter(totalLearned(),52)}<div class="ntc-progressgroups">${[0, 1, 2, 3, 4].map(g=>`<button data-group="${g}">组别 ${g+1}<br>${learned(g)}/${group(g).length}个词语</button>`).join('')}</div>${button('继续学习 →','resume','ntc-primary')}</div>`}
function listView(){return `<div class="ntc-panel">${heading('词汇表','全课共52个词语，点击 ↗ 学习该词语',totalLearned()+'/52 已学习')}<div class="ntc-tablewrap"><table class="ntc-table"><thead><tr><th>汉字</th><th class="ntc-colpinyin">拼音</th><th class="ntc-coltype">词性</th><th>越南语释义</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody>${WORDS.map((d,i)=>`<tr><td class="ntc-hanzi">${d.w} <button class="ntc-play" data-word="${i}" aria-label="学习词语 ${d.w}">↗</button><button class="ntc-play" data-audio-word="${i}" aria-label="听词语 ${d.w}">◖</button></td><td class="ntc-colpinyin">${escapeHTML(d.p)}</td><td class="ntc-coltype">${escapeHTML(d.t)}</td><td>${escapeHTML(d.m)}</td><td>${status(i)}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><div class="ntc-actions"><span class="ntc-caption">仅生词学习分为五组：10、10、10、10、7个词语。</span>${button('开始／继续学习 →','resume','ntc-primary')}</div></div>`}
function studyView(){let d=currentWord(),a=group(ui.g),isLast=d.id===51;return `<div class="ntc-panel">${heading('学习生词 · 组别 '+(ui.g+1),'学习词语、搭配与例句',`${ui.idx+1}/${a.length}`)}${meter(learned(ui.g),a.length)}<div class="ntc-study"><div class="ntc-wordbox"><div class="ntc-pinyin" style="visibility:${ui.pinyin?'visible':'hidden'}">${escapeHTML(d.p)}</div><div class="ntc-bigword ntc-writing" id="ntc-writing" aria-label="汉字笔顺">${d.w}</div><div class="ntc-meaning">${escapeHTML(d.m)}</div><span class="ntc-type">${escapeHTML(d.t)}</span><div class="ntc-smallbtns">${button('笔顺演示','strokes')}<button data-audio-word="${d.id}">◖ 听词语</button>${button(ui.pinyin?'隐藏拼音':'显示拼音','pinyin')}</div></div><div><div class="ntc-label">常用搭配</div><div class="ntc-cn">${escapeHTML(d.coll)}</div><hr><div class="ntc-label">例句</div><div class="ntc-cn">${escapeHTML(d.s)}</div><div class="ntc-smallbtns"><button data-audio-example="${d.id}">◖ 听例句</button></div><div class="ntc-note">${status(d.id)}</div></div></div><div class="ntc-actions">${button('← 上一个','prev-study','',d.id===0)}${button(isLast?'✓ 已学习 · 全课复习 →':ui.idx===a.length-1?'✓ 已学习 · 下一组 →':'✓ 已学习 · 下一个 →','mark-study','ntc-primary')}</div><div class="ntc-footnote">点击“已学习”记录学习进度。需要时，可点击“笔顺演示”查看汉字的书写顺序。</div></div>`}
function markStudy(){let d=currentWord();if(!student.studied.includes(d.id))student.studied.push(d.id);let next=WORDS.find(x=>!student.studied.includes(x.id));if(d.id<51){let id=d.id+1;ui.g=groupOf(id);ui.idx=id-ui.g*10;student.bookmark={g:ui.g,idx:ui.idx}}else if(!next){ui.page=2;student.bookmark={g:4,idx:11};if(!student.flash)startFlash('all',false)}else{ui.g=groupOf(next.id);ui.idx=next.id-ui.g*10;student.bookmark={g:ui.g,idx:ui.idx};toast('还有未学完的词语，请继续学习。')}save();render()}
function flashView(){let f=student.flash;if(f.done)f.done=false;let d=WORDS[f.ids[f.at]];return `<div class="ntc-panel">${heading('词汇卡片 · 全课复习',f.filter==='weak'?'复习练习中答错的词语':'全课52个词语随机排列，不分组',`${f.at+1}/${f.ids.length}`)}${meter(f.at+1,f.ids.length)}<div class="ntc-smallbtns" style="margin-bottom:16px">${button('重新打乱全课52个词语','flash-all')}${button('待复习词语 ('+weakIds().length+')','flash-weak','',!weakIds().length)}</div><div class="ntc-flash"><span class="ntc-label">${f.flipped?'背面':'正面'}</span>${f.flipped?`<span class="ntc-pinyin">${escapeHTML(d.p)}</span><span class="ntc-meaning">${escapeHTML(d.m)}</span><span class="ntc-type">${escapeHTML(d.t)}</span><small>${escapeHTML(d.coll)}</small><div class="ntc-note"><span class="ntc-cn">${escapeHTML(d.s)}</span><button class="ntc-play" data-audio-example="${d.id}" aria-label="听例句">◖</button></div>`:`<div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px"><span class="ntc-bigword" style="font-size:clamp(51px,${d.w.length>2?'7':'10'}vw,${d.w.length>2?'80':'112'}px)">${d.w}</span><button class="ntc-play" data-audio-word="${d.id}" aria-label="听发音 ${d.w}" title="听发音">🔊</button></div>`}<div class="ntc-smallbtns">${button(f.flipped?'↶ 返回正面':'查看释义与例句 ↻','flip')}</div></div><div class="ntc-actions">${button('← 上一张','flash-prev','',f.at===0)}${f.at===f.ids.length-1?button('综合练习 →','quiz-page','ntc-primary'):button('下一张 →','flash-next','ntc-primary')}</div><div class="ntc-footnote">先看正面回忆词义；需要时翻到背面查看拼音、释义与例句。无需翻面即可切换卡片。</div></div>`}
const contextAlternatives={"2": [6, 7, 37], "5": [6, 7, 37], "8": [6, 7, 37], "11": [6, 7, 37], "14": [5, 18, 25], "17": [6, 7, 37], "20": [6, 7, 37], "23": [6, 7, 37], "26": [6, 7, 37], "29": [5, 18, 25], "32": [6, 7, 37], "35": [5, 18, 25], "38": [6, 7, 37], "41": [5, 18, 25], "44": [6, 7, 37], "47": [5, 18, 25], "50": [6, 7, 37]};
function orderView(){let o=student.order;if(o.done)return orderResults();let id=o.ids[o.at],d=WORDS[id],chunks=CHUNKS[id],ok=o.selected.every((x,i)=>x===i);return `<div class="ntc-panel">${heading('连词成句 · 全课复习','使用已学的52个例句，题目随机排列',`${o.at+1}/${o.ids.length}题`)}${meter(o.at,o.ids.length)}<div class="ntc-label">重点词语 · ${d.w}</div><p class="ntc-caption">按顺序选择词语，点击已选词语可将其放回。</p><div class="ntc-orderanswer ${o.checked?(ok?'ntc-correct':'ntc-wrong'):''}" aria-label="已排列的句子">${o.selected.length?o.selected.map((index,i)=>`<button data-remove="${i}" ${o.checked?'disabled':''}>${escapeHTML(chunks[index])}</button>`).join(''):'<span class="ntc-caption">请在这里排列句子……</span>'}</div><div class="ntc-chunks" aria-label="待选词语">${o.bank.map(index=>`<button class="${o.selected.includes(index)?'used':''}" data-chunk="${index}" ${o.checked||o.selected.includes(index)?'disabled':''}>${escapeHTML(chunks[index])}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="ntc-actions"><div class="ntc-smallbtns">${button('↶ 撤销最后一项','order-undo','',!o.selected.length||o.checked)}${button('重新排列','order-clear','',!o.selected.length||o.checked)}</div>${button('检查答案','order-check','ntc-primary',o.selected.length!==chunks.length||o.checked)}</div>${o.checked?`<div class="ntc-note" role="status"><strong>${ok?'✓ 与例句顺序一致':'✕ 与例句顺序不一致'}</strong><div class="ntc-label">原例句</div><div class="ntc-cn">${escapeHTML(d.s)}</div><button data-audio-example="${id}">◖ 听例句</button></div><div class="ntc-actions"><span></span>${button(o.at===o.ids.length-1?'查看结果 →':'下一题 →','order-next','ntc-primary')}</div>`:''}<div class="ntc-footnote">本练习按原例句顺序评分，其他语序也可能符合语法。</div></div>`}
function orderResults(){let o=student.order,wrong=o.answers.filter(x=>!x.ok).map(x=>x.id),correct=o.answers.length-wrong.length;return `<div class="ntc-panel">${heading('连词成句结果','第23课综合复习')}<div class="ntc-score">${correct}<small> / ${o.answers.length}题答对</small></div><div class="ntc-tag">${wrong.length} 题需要重新练习</div>${wrong.map(id=>`<div class="ntc-miniresult"><strong>${WORDS[id].w}</strong><br><span class="ntc-cn">${escapeHTML(WORDS[id].s)}</span></div>`).join('')}<div class="ntc-actions">${button('重新练习全课句子','order-restart')}${button('重练错题','order-retry','',!wrong.length)}${button('查看学习统计 →','stats-page','ntc-primary')}</div></div>`}
function statsView(){let weak=weakIds();return `<div class="ntc-panel">${heading('学习统计','当前浏览器中的第23课学习进度','第23课 · 52个词语')}<div class="ntc-statrow"><div class="ntc-stat"><label>已学词语</label><strong>${totalLearned()}<small> / 52</small></strong></div><div class="ntc-stat"><label>需要复习</label><strong>${weak.length}<small>个词语</small></strong></div></div><div class="ntc-tablewrap"><table class="ntc-table"><thead><tr><th>组别</th><th>已学习</th><th>待复习</th><th>综合练习</th><th>连词成句</th></tr></thead><tbody>${[0, 1, 2, 3, 4].map(g=>`<tr><td>组别 ${g+1}<div class="ntc-caption">${group(g).length}个词语</div></td><td>${learned(g)}/${group(g).length}</td><td>${group(g).filter(d=>memory(d.id)==='review').length}</td><td>${activityScore('quiz',g)}</td><td>${activityScore('order',g)}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div><div class="ntc-footnote">按词语所属组显示答对题数／已答题数。优先显示本轮进度，否则显示最近一轮结果。</div><hr><div class="ntc-sectionhead"><h2>待复习词语</h2>${button('用词汇卡片复习 →','flash-weak','',!weak.length||!allLearned())}</div><div class="ntc-terms">${weak.length?weak.map(id=>`<button data-word="${id}">${WORDS[id].w}</button>`).join(''):'<span class="ntc-caption">暂无需要复习的错词。</span>'}</div><div class="ntc-note">继续学习：组别 ${student.bookmark.g+1} · 词语 ${student.bookmark.idx+1}/${group(student.bookmark.g).length}.<br>本页累计学习时间约 ${Math.floor(student.timeMs/60000)} 分钟。已完成综合练习轮数： ${student.quizHistory.length}; 连词成句轮数： ${student.orderHistory.length}.</div><div class="ntc-actions">${button('继续学习','resume','ntc-primary')}${button('导出学习记录','backup')}${button('恢复学习记录','restore')}</div><div class="ntc-footnote">答错词语会列入待复习词语。浏览词汇卡片不等于掌握词语。</div></div>`}
function render(){clearWriting();let total=totalLearned();$('ntc-profile-button').textContent='HSK6 · 第23课';$('ntc-bookmark').textContent=student?total+'/52 个已学词语':'';$('ntc-tabs').innerHTML=pages.map((name,i)=>`<button class="ntc-tab ${ui.page===i?'active':''}" data-page="${i}" aria-pressed="${ui.page===i}">${i<5?i+1+'. ':''}${name}${i>=2&&i<=4&&!allLearned()?' 🔒':''}</button>`).join('');let showGroups=ui.page===1;$('ntc-groups').hidden=!showGroups;$('ntc-groups').innerHTML=showGroups?[0, 1, 2, 3, 4].map(g=>`<button data-group="${g}" class="${g===ui.g?'active':''}">组别 ${g+1} · ${group(g).length}个词语 · ${learned(g)}/${group(g).length}</button>`).join(''):'';$('ntc-sidegroups').innerHTML=showGroups?'<div class="ntc-navtitle">当前词汇组</div>'+[0, 1, 2, 3, 4].map(g=>`<button class="ntc-sidegroup ${g===ui.g?'active':''}" data-group="${g}"><span>组别 ${g+1}<br><small>词语 ${g*10+1}–${g*10+group(g).length}</small></span><small>${learned(g)}/${group(g).length}</small></button>`).join(''):'<div class="ntc-navtitle">第23课学习进度</div><div style="padding:0 10px">'+total+'/52 个已学词语'+meter(total,52)+'</div>';$('ntc-sidefoot').innerHTML='学完生词 →<br>全课综合复习。<br><br>进度保存在<br>当前浏览器中。';let html;if(ui.page>=2&&ui.page<=4&&!allLearned())html=gate();else html=[listView,studyView,flashView,quizView,orderView,statsView][ui.page]();$('ntc-view').innerHTML=html;if(ui.page===1)setupWriting();}
const AUDIO_INDEX={"通俗":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","老师用通俗易懂的语言解释了这个复杂的概念。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","堆积":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","如果不及时整理，这些文件很快就会堆积在桌上。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","卓越":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","这位研究者长期坚持探索在相关领域取得了卓越成就。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","预测":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","团队根据已有数据预测变化趋势同时说明预测存在的局限。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","功劳":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","这项工作能够完成是大家共同努力的结果不能把功劳都归于一个人。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","派遣":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","为了核实情况，机构派遣工作人员前往当地开展调查。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","战略":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","制定发展战略时，企业需要综合考虑自身条件和外部环境。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","模型":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","研究者建立了一个模型用于分析不同因素之间的关系。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","共计":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","本次调查共计收到一百份问卷其中部分还需要进一步核实。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","验证":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","一个看似合理的结论仍然需要通过可靠的证据加以验证。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","万分":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","得知自己的申请获得通过，她万分激动立刻把消息告诉了家人。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","振奋":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","这项工作的进展令人振奋也让团队更加坚定了继续研究的信心。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","公认":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","这项成果经过长期实践的检验逐渐得到了同行的公认。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","扭转":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","面对不利的局面，团队及时调整方案努力扭转原有的趋势。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","先前":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","比较先前的记录，我们发现了几处值得进一步研究的变化。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","陈旧":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","这套设备虽然已经十分陈旧却仍然保存着重要的历史信息。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","被动":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","学习时，如果只被动接受信息就很难形成独立思考的习惯。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","防治":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","农业人员结合当地情况制定了防治病虫害的方案。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","消灭":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","为了减少害虫对庄稼的影响，工作人员采取了措施消灭田间的害虫。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","萌芽":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","这个想法最初只是一个萌芽经过反复讨论才逐渐形成完整的方案。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","荒谬":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","这个说法既没有依据又与已知事实矛盾显得十分荒谬。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","前提":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","资料真实可靠是开展这项研究不可缺少的重要前提。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","交代":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","出发前，负责人把各自的任务交代得十分清楚。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","追究":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","处理问题时，既要查明事实也要按照规定追究相关人员的责任。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","基因":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","这篇文章介绍了基因研究的基本概念并说明了相关信息保护的重要性。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","遗传":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","研究人员比较了不同资料探讨遗传因素与环境因素各自的作用。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","预料":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","事情的变化超出了原先的预料大家只好重新商量应对办法。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","消除":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","经过坦诚的交流，双方逐渐消除了误会重新建立了信任。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","隐患":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","工作人员定期检查设备及时发现可能存在的安全隐患。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","预兆":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","这些细微的变化可能是某种问题的预兆，但仍需结合其他资料作进一步判断。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","案例":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","老师选择了几个典型案例引导学生比较不同的解决办法。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","零星":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","起初研究者只能找到一些零星的相关资料。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","挽救":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","他们及时发现问题重新调整计划努力挽救不利的局面。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","细致":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","这份报告对资料进行了细致分析每一项判断都有明确的依据。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","不言而喻":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","可靠资料对于研究的重要性不言而喻，因此收集时必须认真核实。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","血压":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","填写健康记录时，工作人员按照要求录入了血压测量结果。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","先进":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","引进先进设备以后，团队也重视相关人员的培训与使用指导。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","器材":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","实验结束后，学生把使用过的器材整理好并放回原处。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","人为":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","检查数据时，我们发现其中的差异主要来自人为失误。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","前景":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","讨论这项技术的前景时，既要看到潜力也需要认真分析现实的限制。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","临床":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","这篇报道介绍了临床研究的流程强调结论应当经过严格验证。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","依赖":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","我们不应过分依赖工具，而忽视自己的独立判断。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","切切实实":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","这项服务希望切切实实地帮助用户解决日常使用中遇到的困难。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","切实":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","面对实际问题，我们需要提出切实可行的改进措施。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","优越":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","这里拥有较为优越的研究条件为团队的工作提供了有力支持。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","维护":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","工作人员定期维护设备以便及时发现运行中的问题。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","协助":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","她主动协助同事整理资料帮助团队按时完成了准备工作。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","生理":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","这套图示用直观的方式介绍了人体基本的生理结构。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","攒":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","为了购买需要的设备，他每个月都攒一点钱慢慢接近自己的目标。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","可行":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","在正式实施之前，团队先通过小规模试验判断方案是否可行。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","实事求是":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","评价研究结果时，应当坚持实事求是的态度，既不夸大成绩，也不回避不足。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","展望":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,","文章最后，作者展望了相关领域未来可能的发展方向。":"data:audio/mpeg;base64,"};
function backup(){const content=JSON.stringify({format:'ntc-hsk6-bai23-v3',profile:student},null,2);let url=URL.createObjectURL(new Blob([content],{type:'application/json'})),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download='HSK6_Bai23_TienDo.json';a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),2000)}
function restore(){let input=document.createElement('input');input.type='file';input.accept='.json,application/json';input.addEventListener('change',async()=>{try{let v=JSON.parse(await input.files[0].text()),p=v.profile;if(v.format!=='ntc-hsk6-bai23-v3'||!p||typeof p.name!=='string'||typeof p.clas!=='string'||!Array.isArray(p.studied)||p.studied.some(id=>!Number.isInteger(id)||id<0||id>=52)||!p.memory)throw Error();if(!confirm('恢复第23课学习记录？当前记录将被替换。'))return;let id=store.active||'local';let clean=createStudent(p.name,p.clas);clean.studied=[...new Set(p.studied)];for(let k=0;k<52;k++)if(['remembered','review'].includes(p.memory[k]))clean.memory[k]=p.memory[k];if(p.bookmark&&Number.isInteger(p.bookmark.g)&&p.bookmark.g>=0&&p.bookmark.g<5&&Number.isInteger(p.bookmark.idx)&&p.bookmark.idx>=0&&p.bookmark.idx<group(p.bookmark.g).length)clean.bookmark=p.bookmark;for(let key of ['quizHistory','orderHistory'])if(Array.isArray(p[key]))clean[key]=p[key].filter(r=>r&&Array.isArray(r.answers)&&r.answers.every(a=>Number.isInteger(a.id)&&a.id>=0&&a.id<52&&typeof a.ok==='boolean'));clean.timeMs=Math.max(0,Number(p.timeMs)||0);store.profiles[id]=clean;store.active=id;student=clean;ui={page:5,g:0,idx:0,pinyin:false};save();render();toast('已恢复已学词语、复习状态与练习记录。')}catch(e){toast('无法读取有效的HSK6第23课学习记录。')}});input.click()}
root.addEventListener('click',event=>{let b=event.target.closest('button');if(!b||b.disabled)return;const data=b.dataset;if(data.audioWord!==undefined){speak(WORDS[+data.audioWord].w);return}if(data.audioExample!==undefined){speak(WORDS[+data.audioExample].s);return}if(data.page!==undefined){go(+data.page);return}if(data.group!==undefined){chooseGroup(+data.group);return}if(data.word!==undefined){let id=+data.word;ui.g=groupOf(id);ui.idx=id-ui.g*10;go(1);return}if(data.answer!==undefined){stopAudio();pickQuiz(+data.answer);return}if(data.chunk!==undefined){addChunk(+data.chunk);return}if(data.remove!==undefined){removeChunk(+data.remove);return}let a=data.action;if(!a)return;if(a==='stop'){stopAudio();return}switch(a){case'strokes':animateWriting();return;case'resume':ui.g=student.bookmark.g;ui.idx=student.bookmark.idx;go(1);return;case'pinyin':ui.pinyin=!ui.pinyin;break;case'prev-study':{let id=currentWord().id-1;ui.g=groupOf(id);ui.idx=id-ui.g*10;break}case'mark-study':stopAudio();markStudy();return;case'flip':student.flash.flipped=!student.flash.flipped;break;case'flash-all':if(!allLearned()){go(2);return}ui.page=2;startFlash('all');return;case'flash-weak':if(!allLearned()){go(2);return}ui.page=2;startFlash('weak');return;case'flash-prev':student.flash.at--;student.flash.flipped=false;break;case'flash-next':student.flash.at++;student.flash.flipped=false;break;case'quiz-page':go(3);return;case'order-page':go(4);return;case'stats-page':go(5);return;case'quiz-as-meaning':student.quiz.questions[student.quiz.at].type='meaning';break;case'quiz-next':stopAudio();nextQuiz();return;case'quiz-restart':startQuiz();return;case'quiz-retry':startQuiz(true,student.quiz.questions.filter(x=>x.picked!==x.correct).map(x=>x.id));return;case'order-undo':removeChunk(student.order.selected.length-1);return;case'order-clear':student.order.selected=[];break;case'order-check':checkOrder();return;case'order-next':stopAudio();nextOrder();return;case'order-restart':startOrder();return;case'order-retry':startOrder(student.order.answers.filter(x=>!x.ok).map(x=>x.id));return;case'backup':backup();return;case'restore':restore();return;default:return}save();render()});
root.addEventListener('change',event=>{if(event.target.id==='ntc-rate')speed=Number(event.target.value)});


let strokeWriters=[],strokeRun=0;
async function animateWriting(){const token=++strokeRun,list=[...strokeWriters];if(!list.length){toast('暂时无法显示笔顺。');return;}const button=root.querySelector('[data-action="strokes"]');if(button)button.disabled=true;try{for(const w of list)await w.hideCharacter({duration:0});for(const w of list){if(token!==strokeRun)return;await w.animateCharacter();}}finally{if(token===strokeRun&&button)button.disabled=false;}}

let lastTick=Date.now();setInterval(()=>{let now=Date.now();if(student&&!document.hidden){student.timeMs+=Math.min(now-lastTick,15000);save()}lastTick=now},15000);
window.addEventListener('pagehide',()=>{save();stopAudio()});
if(student&&ui.page>=2&&ui.page<=4&&allLearned()){if(ui.page===2&&!student.flash)startFlash('all',false);if(ui.page===3&&!student.quiz)startQuiz(false);if(ui.page===4&&!student.order)startOrder(null,false)}
save();render();if(!storageOK)toast('浏览器阻止保存数据，建议导出学习记录作为备份。');

